ence, and goals.", "children": [{"id": "3fedf534-ed74-44e9-9638-bdcb7b39bbfa", "type": "concept", "title": "Motivational interviewing basics"}, {"id": "1312dab7-842f-49f0-bfd0-a2b7fc3f6b3c", "type": "concept", "title": "Open questions, affirmations, reflections, and summaries"}, {"id": "58e6f707-6801-43ab-820b-569c424443eb", "type": "concept", "title": "Plain language and health literacy"}]}, {"id": "244d70bf-fe75-473b-9fa8-163bfa01c9d8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Behavior change theory", "description": "Students connect interventions to theories of motivation and environment.", "children": [{"id": "1d9c9d37-b5f9-455d-85a0-ba0adb8458bf", "type": "concept", "title": "Stages of change"}, {"id": "4072fec0-3386-4883-8342-550f4e24ac98", "type": "concept", "title": "Social cognitive theory and self-efficacy"}, {"id": "94bbe471-0e73-46af-81cf-5d6b47900734", "type": "concept", "title": "Nudges, cues, defaults, and habit design"}]}, {"id": "01c05654-aad9-4897-9802-723887314df2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Program planning", "description": "Students learn how nutrition education becomes a community or workplace program.", "children": [{"id": "5637aa9a-9f1a-4e8c-b5c1-f3dded5ec67c", "type": "concept", "title": "Needs assessment and priority populations"}, {"id": "492bb35f-2c0b-4d8d-99d7-a52a2e1dbcd4", "type": "concept", "title": "Learning objectives, activities, and materials"}, {"id": "eef8f6b3-36ed-493d-9e84-b6ac9d625a1c", "type": "concept", "title": "Process, outcome, and equity evaluation"}]}]}, {"id": "27860d18-a1b6-4484-97d6-3cb7f2fea27f", "type": "topic", "title": "Applied Nutrition and Wellness Portfolio / Capstone", "description": "Students synthesize evidence, assessment, communication, equity, and planning through a practical nutrition and wellness portfolio.", "children": [{"id": "702ed06c-daa1-4b7d-b5c4-cfe5dbf9ebee", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Personal diet analysis", "description": "Students apply methods to a realistic intake record and interpret results responsibly.", "children": [{"id": "958f612d-d098-4afb-9148-8f8d6473f205", "type": "concept", "title": "Nutrient gaps and diet quality strengths"}, {"id": "aab8e463-cab6-4b25-87e4-05756e1f3734", "type": "concept", "title": "Pattern-level recommendations"}, {"id": "644f0656-d9bf-4a1a-83a0-6acdeec32279", "type": "concept", "title": "Reflection on accuracy and context"}]}, {"id": "6c7d9c93-edcc-42c7-9d9c-16a34c89b98c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Evidence brief", "description": "Students practice writing a concise, balanced response to a nutrition question.", "children": [{"id": "b59e27f8-6499-4eda-961a-ab47d977cd72", "type": "concept", "title": "Search strategy and source quality"}, {"id": "4a75a6a8-82f8-43b1-80ad-5aed25081539", "type": "concept", "title": "Claim, evidence, uncertainty, and practical takeaway"}, {"id": "988a321c-75ba-43d8-8096-4fbeaa5f288c", "type": "concept", "title": "Misinformation correction without shaming"}]}, {"id": "958740ad-9b91-4d19-b64e-b0e72b5fb20b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Wellness plan or program", "description": "Students synthesize the course into an actionable, culturally responsive plan.", "children": [{"id": "2e9b7fba-7d30-4dad-9b48-ff722f1258a1", "type": "concept", "title": "Individual or community target population"}, {"id": "b67ea7bf-b97a-4913-a9ea-3e2e0aff0d21", "type": "concept", "title": "Nutrition, activity, sleep, stress, and access strategies"}, {"id": "bcc5a1a3-8e4d-47b7-9ad3-f00990ad26c7", "type": "concept", "title": "Evaluation metrics and referral boundaries"}]}]}], "dbBacked": true}$nawjson$::jsonb,
